{
    "title": "Chewy: Pet Shopping & Delivery",
    "description": "App Exclusive Deal: Get $5 off your first app purchase. Use code: APP during checkout. Limited time, terms apply.\r\n\r\nThis one\u2019s for the pets. Shop all the things that keep your pet happy and healthy with Chewy, the trusted destination for pet parents. With 3000+ brands of food and supplies, and 24/7 help from pet experts, your pet\u2019s happiness is our #1 priority. Unlock high quality and low priced products, Autoship delivery, free 365-day returns and more. Food shop and pharmacy \u2014 no matter what you need, Chewy has you covered.\r\n\r\nDownload and discover something for every pet. Dog, cat, fish, reptile, horse or wildlife \u2014 all pets are supported on the Chewy app. Find everything your pet needs today.\r\n\r\n<b>SHOPPING FOR EVERY PET</b>\r\nThe shopping app that\u2019s  built to make your pet parenting life easier. Shop top brands, exclusive deals and the best of each season for your pet.\r\n\u2022 Shop by Category - Search or shop by category to discover the best products for your pet.\r\n\u2022 3000+ Brands - Browse thousands of trusted brands, ensuring you have the best selection possible.\r\n\u2022 Today\u2019s Deals - Shopping app deals, for every pet. Find the best savings of the day on everything from food to treats, toys, supplies and apparel.\r\n\u2022 Holiday Shop - Calling all party animals! Celebrate the holiday season with costumes, toys, seasonal treats and more.\r\n\r\n<b>PHARMACY & VET SUPPORT</b>\r\nPet health, made easy. Get veterinary and pharmacy support with Chewy\u2019s expansive health services and products.\r\n\u2022 Trusted Pet Pharmacy - Care for your pet with America\u2019s most trusted pharmacy, carrying over 4000+ top-quality medications and 600+ veterinary diet products. Now including compounded medications.\r\n\u2022 Rx Approvals - Share your pet and veterinary info and we\u2019ll confirm your prescription directly with your vet before shipping.\r\n\u2022 Connect with a Vet - Get timely advice from our licensed veterinary team and leave with a personalized consult report.\r\n\u2022 Symptom Tracker - Share your pet\u2019s symptoms and receive quick advice on what to do next.\r\n\u2022 Medicine Reminders - Add your pet\u2019s current medications and we\u2019ll remind you on when to refill based on the frequency you need.\r\n\r\n<b>AUTOSHIP & SEAMLESS HOME DELIVERY</b>\r\nVeterinary prescription, pet food, or fun toys \u2014 get fast, easy and hassle-free deliveries with Chewy.\r\n\u2022 Manage Autoship - What your pet needs, on repeat. Schedule your Autoship delivery at checkout and change as needed. No fees or commitments, just happy pets.\r\n\u2022 Super Savings - Get extra savings off your first Autoship order and 5% off future deliveries.\r\n\u2022 Shipment Tracker - Follow their favorite box from our door to yours with our in-app shipment tracker.\r\n\r\n<b>PET COMMUNITY</b>\r\nTrusted by pet lovers, and supported by pet experts. Learn, receive help, share your voice and give back with our app. No one pet-parents alone with Chewy.\r\n\u2022 24/7 Support - Real pet experts are here for you 24/7 to support all pet parents.\r\n\u2022 Sharing - Send fellow pet lovers items you like with a text, email or social post while you shop.\r\n\u2022 Shopping App Reviews - Read what other customers are saying about products and leave your own reviews.\r\n\u2022 Pet Adoption - Find pets to adopt near you through Chewy\u2019s network of shelters and rescues.\r\n\r\nFood shop, pharmacy, vet advice and more. No matter what you\u2019re looking for \u2014 Chewy is here to make pet parenting easier.",
